{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-disruption-culture","title":"成本颠覆文化：将 $75,000 机器人降到 $2,700 的组织信仰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/cost-disruption-culture","wordCount":3056,"readingTime":13},{"seq":2,"slug":"engineer-founder-spirit","title":"工程师创始人精神：从浙大实验室到百亿估值的技术信仰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/engineer-founder-spirit","wordCount":3220,"readingTime":13},{"seq":3,"slug":"open-source-robotics","title":"开源机器人哲学：SDK 开放与开发者生态的战略价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/open-source-robotics","wordCount":3043,"readingTime":13},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"宇树科技使命愿景价值观：让每个人都能拥有机器人","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":1740,"readingTime":7},{"seq":5,"slug":"wang-xingxing-leadership","title":"王兴兴创始人领导力：偏科战神的机器人帝国","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/wang-xingxing-leadership","wordCount":1946,"readingTime":8},{"seq":6,"slug":"cost-disruption-deep","title":"极致成本颠覆深度：如何做到波士顿动力 1/50 价格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/cost-disruption-deep","wordCount":2347,"readingTime":10},{"seq":7,"slug":"chinese-robotics-revolution","title":"中国机器人革命：宇树科技的全球引领地位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/unitree/culture-and-values/chinese-robotics-revolution","wordCount":2230,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"文化与价值观-简介\">文化与价值观 简介</h1><p>宇树科技的文化基因可以追溯到创始人王兴兴在浙江大学实验室的那些日夜——当全球顶尖实验室用几十万美元的预算打造一台四足机器人时，这个年轻的博士生在思考一个根本性的问题：为什么机器人不能像手机一样便宜？</p>\n<p>这个问题催生了宇树最核心的文化特质：对成本的极致追求不是&quot;省钱&quot;，而是一种重新定义产品边界的方法论。当 Boston Dynamics 的 Spot 定价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>74</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>时，宇树的</mtext><mi>G</mi><mi>o</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext>以</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">74,500 时，宇树的 Go1 以</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">74</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时，宇树的</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">以</span></span></span></span></span>2,700 入市——这不是简单的低价竞争，而是用完全不同的工程思路和供应链逻辑实现的成本结构革命。</p>\n<p>本章从三个维度拆解宇树的文化内核：</p>\n<p><strong>成本颠覆文化</strong>分析宇树如何将&quot;让机器人便宜到人人可用&quot;从愿景变为工程实践，包括模块化设计、消费电子供应链复用、以及自研核心部件的策略选择。</p>\n<p><strong>工程师创始人精神</strong>探讨王兴兴作为技术极客型创始人如何塑造了公司的决策文化——在宇树，技术判断优先于市场判断，工程师的直觉比 PPT 更有说服力。</p>\n<p><strong>开源机器人哲学</strong>解读宇树为何选择开放 SDK 和开发者生态，以及这一策略如何帮助宇树在教育和科研市场建立了难以撼动的网络效应。</p>\n"}